ospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Repro steps\\n\\n1. Open a PDF on a display reporting a scale factor above 1.0 (tested at 150% and 200%).\\n\\n2. Compare the redaction preview overlay's reported box coordinates against the coordinates the rendering library reports for the same region.\\n\\n3. At scale factors above 1.0, the overlay box is offset from the actual text region, with the offset growing as scale factor increases.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nThe misalignment reproduces consistently at both tested scale factors. It does not reproduce at 100% scale.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nRoot cause has not been isolated as part of this reproduction pass; this note only establishes that the defect reproduces and under which display conditions.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 test log reproduct note for the high dpi coordin misalign report for ciph 46 first reproduc 2026 08 17 sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 repro step 1 open a pdf on a display report a scale factor abov 10 test at 150 and 200 2 compar the redact preview overlay s report box coordin against the coordin the render librari report for the same region 3 at scale factor abov 10 the overlay box is offset from the actual text region with the offset grow a scale factor increas sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 result the misalign reproduc consist at both test scale factor it doe not reproduc at 100 scale sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 status root caus ha not been isol a part of this reproduct pas this note onli establish that the defect reproduc and under which display condit\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"id\": \"a55699b32432c8bc\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.36237252111068724, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20068845158669607, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73963535, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 987, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:58\", \"token_count\": 453, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-31\\n\\n# Engineering Note: Async Job Scheduler\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2031\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-04 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-20)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the async job scheduler added 2026-08-20 to the batch API under CIPH-47, for higher throughput under concurrent load.\\n\\n## What was added\\n\\nAn asynchronous scheduler that accepts batch API jobs and dispatches them to worker threads without blocking the request path, building on the multi-threading work already integrated into the batch CLI.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-31\\n\\n# Engineering Note: Async Job Scheduler\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2031\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-04 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-20)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the async job scheduler added 2026-08-20 to the batch API under CIPH-47, for higher throughput under concurrent load.\\n\\n## Design\\n\\nJobs are queued with a job ID returned immediately to the caller; a separate status endpoint reports progress. Workers pull from the same queue used by the multi-threaded batch path.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-31\\n\\n# Engineering Note: Async Job Scheduler\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2031\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-04 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-20)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the async job scheduler added 2026-08-20 to the batch API under CIPH-47, for higher throughput under concurrent load.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nThis note covers the scheduler's implementation and design only. It does not cover any concurrency issues found during later evaluation of the scheduler under load; those are separate from what this note documents.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 31 engin note async job schedul owner bob document key doc 2031 last updat 2026 09 04 retrospect cover 2026 08 20 retrospect note on the async job schedul ad 2026 08 20 to the batch api under ciph 47 for higher throughput under concurr load what wa ad an asynchron schedul that accept batch api job and dispatch them to worker thread without block the request path build on the multi thread work alreadi integr into the batch cli sourc id src gdoc 31 engin note async job schedul owner bob document key doc 2031 last updat 2026 09 04 retrospect cover 2026 08 20 retrospect note on the 