 \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.24044795079245385, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6929269, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-12-batch-failures.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e906ce748a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-12-batch-failures.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-12-batch-failures.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1616, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:03\", \"token_count\": 478, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-19\\n\\n# OCR Temp File Path Trace\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2019\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-20 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-07)\\n\\nRetrospective trace of where the OCR fallback module writes temporary files during a run, recorded 2026-08-07.\\n\\n## Traced paths\\n\\nA single run of the per-page OCR fallback pool creates three categories of temporary artifact:\\n\\n1. A per-page rasterized image, one file per page, in a process-local temp directory.\\n\\n2. A per-page OCR output buffer, written before confidence-threshold filtering is applied.\\n\\n3. A run-level manifest listing which pages fell back to OCR versus native text extraction.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-19\\n\\n# OCR Temp File Path Trace\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2019\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-20 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-07)\\n\\nRetrospective trace of where the OCR fallback module writes temporary files during a run, recorded 2026-08-07.\\n\\n## Purpose of this trace\\n\\nThis trace was compiled as an input to the ephemeral-file-cleanup work so that whatever cleanup mechanism is built has a concrete list of paths to target. It only records where files land and when they are created.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-19\\n\\n# OCR Temp File Path Trace\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2019\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-20 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-07)\\n\\nRetrospective trace of where the OCR fallback module writes temporary files during a run, recorded 2026-08-07.\\n\\n## Open item\\n\\nConfirming that these three path categories are actually removed after a run, on both the success and failure paths, is outside the scope of this trace and is not addressed here.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 19 ocr temp file path trace owner charli document key doc 2019 last updat 2026 08 20 retrospect cover 2026 08 07 retrospect trace of where the ocr fallback modul write temporari file dure a run record 2026 08 07 trace path a singl run of the per page ocr fallback pool creat three categori of temporari artifact 1a per page raster imag one file per page in a process local temp directori 2 a per page ocr output buffer written befor confid threshold filter is appli 3a run level manifest list which page fell back to ocr versus nativ text extract sourc id src gdoc 19 ocr temp file path trace owner charli document key doc 2019 last updat 2026 08 20 retrospect cover 2026 08 07 retrospect trace of where the ocr fallback modul write temporari file dure a run record 2026 08 07 purpos of this trace this trace wa compil a an input to the ephemer file cleanup work so that whatev cleanup mechan is built ha a concret list of path to target it onli record where file land and when they are creat sourc id src gdoc 19 ocr temp file path trace owner charli document key doc 2019 last updat 2026 08 20 retrospect cover 2026 08 07 retrospect trace of where the ocr fallback modul write temporari file dure a run record 2026 08 07 open item confirm that these three path categori are actual remov after a run on both the success and failur path is outsid the scope of this trace and is not address here\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9bc34308a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"id\": \"fe18ec7a34fc43e6\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2850029193909504, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.09613801341564342, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7256877, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9bc34308a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1093, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:30\", \"token_count\": 435, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-40\\n\\n# Ephemeral OCR Temp Cleanup — Verification Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2040\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-20\\n\\n*Retrospective note: this summarizes the 2026-08-11 secure-deletion confirmation for T025, written up today.*\\n\\nOCR fallback leaves temporary files on disk. Those files must not survive after a failed page or after a successful completion.\\n\\n## Confirmation\\n\\nEarlier work traced OCR temp-creation sites and added cleanup hooks on failure and completion. On 2026-08-11 Diana verified those hooks: ephemeral OCR temps were removed after both failure and successful completion paths.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-40\\n\\n# Ephemeral OCR Temp Cleanup — Verification Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2040\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-20\\n\\n*Retrospective note: this summarizes the 2026-08-11 secure-deletion confirmation for T025, written up today.*\\n\\nOCR fallback leaves temporary files on disk. Those files must not survive after a failed page or after a successful completion.\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nCompleted. Secure deletion of ephemeral OCR temps is confirmed for the paths covered by this check. This report does not raise a separate open remanence finding beyond that confirmation.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 40 ephemer ocr temp cleanup verif report owner diana document key doc 2040 last updat 2026 08 20 retrospect note this summar the 2026 08 11 secur delet confirm for t025 written up today ocr fallback leaf temporari file on disk those file must not surviv after a fail page or after a success complet confirm earlier work trace ocr temp creation site and ad cleanup hook on failur and complet on 2026 08 11 diana verifi those hook ephemer ocr temp were remov after both failur and success complet path sourc id src gdoc 40 ephemer ocr temp cleanup verif report owner diana document key doc 2040 last updat 2026 08 20 retrospect note this summar the 2026 08 11 secur delet confirm for t025 written up today ocr fallback leaf temporari file on disk those file must not surviv after a fail page or after a success complet result complet secur delet of ephemer ocr temp is confirm for the path cover by this check this report doe not rais a separ open reman find beyond that confirm\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e999e4488a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"id\": \"f3e81d2903f541fe\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2539069718099749, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.0524389168713927, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7239991, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e999e4488a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 832, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:00\", \"token_count\": 305, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \" - *Opened the task to build a centralized audit-trail system for tracking redaction activity across the pipeline.*\\n\\n- **2026-07-11**: Bob - Loader Refactor (Active)\\n\\n - *Refactored the document loader to prepare for streaming input ahead of hashing and audit capture.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-05**: Bob - SHA-256 Hashing (Active)\\n\\n - *Added SHA-256 hashing of input streams because the audit design requires an input hash alongside the redaction map.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-15**: Bob - Audit Schema Definition (Active)\\n\\n - *Defined the companion JSON audit schema (hash + redaction map) needed before CLI wiring.*\\n\\n- **2026-09-10**: Bob - CLI Integration (Active)\\n\\n - *Wired audit-log generation into the CLI path now that the schema was defined, to satisfy the release gate.*\\n\\n- **2026-09-18**: Diana - Audit Verify (Mismatch) (Active)\\n\\n - *Verification found the CLI-emitted audit records inconsistent with the defined schema; this mismatch remains an open release blocker.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"open the task to build a central audit trail system for track redact activ across the pipelin 2026 07 11 bob loader refactor activ refactor the document loader to prepar for stream input ahead of hash and audit captur 2026 08 05 bob sha 256 hash activ ad sha 256 hash of input stream becaus the audit design requir an input hash alongsid the redact map 2026 08 15 bob audit schema definit activ defin the companion json audit schema hash redact map need befor cli wire 2026 09 10 bob cli integr activ wire audit log generat into the cli path now that the schema wa defin to satisfi the releas gate 2026 09 18 diana audit verifi mismatch activ verif found the cli emit audit record inconsist with the defin schema this mismatch remain an open releas blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"a015962ae73f1229\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.24664292180997488, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.0524389168713927, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6997856, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:38\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## Original Finding: Ghostscript (AGPLv3)\\n\\nThe initial audit flagged `Ghostscript`, used by the `rasterizer` module for PDF-to-image conversion, as AGPLv3-licensed — on the corporate license blacklist because of its viral copyleft terms for any binary distributed to partner sites.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## First Remediation and Reopen\\n\\nThe team swapped in an alternative PDF parser library to replace the Ghostscript dependency, and that swap was initially marked Completed. On follow-up review, however, the replacement library itself turned out to also be AGPL-licensed — the swap solved the specific Ghostscript dependency but reintroduced the same license category problem one layer down. The task was reopened.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## Current Status: Unresolved\\n\\nCharlie is now searching for an Apache 2.0 or MIT-licensed PDF parser alternative that meets the module's rasterization requirements. No suitable replacement has been confirmed yet, so this audit item remains **Active (Reopened)** — not resolved.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## Secondary Open Item\\n\\nTesseract OCR itself is Apache 2.0, but the `eng.traineddata` model files were sourced from a community repository and their training-corpus provenance has not been verified as public-domain/CC0. This remains a separate, lower-priority open item pending Evan's trace of the `tessdata_best` provenance.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 origin find ghostscript agplv3 the initi audit flag ghostscript use by the raster modul for pdf to imag convers a agplv3 licens on the corpor licens blacklist becaus of it viral copyleft term for ani binari distribut to partner site sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 first remedi and reopen the team swap in an altern pdf parser librari to replac the ghostscript depend and that swap wa initi mark complet on follow up review howev the replac librari itself turn out to also be agpl licens the swap solv the specif ghostscript depend but reintroduc the same licens categori problem one layer down the task wa reopen sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 current status unresolv charli is now search for an apach 20 or mit licens pdf parser altern that meet the modul s raster requir no suitabl replac ha been confirm yet so this audit item remain activ reopen not resolv sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 secondari open item tesseract ocr itself is apach 20 but the eng traineddata model file were sourc from a communiti repositori and their train corpus proven ha not been verifi a public domain cc0 this remain a separ lower prioriti open item pend evan s trace of the tessdata _ best proven\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9d4f0568a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"id\": \"039b629d788751dd\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.24663794317831123, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.05772397596901603, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6874372, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9d4f0568a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1689, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:12\", \"token_count\": 582, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-28\\n\\n# Slack Thread: OCR Temp File Trace\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-07\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 10:03] Charlie**: Tracing every place the OCR branch writes a temp file. We can't add cleanup hooks until we know all the sites that actually create one.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 10:06] Alice**: How many sites so far?\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 10:19] Charlie**: More than I expected. Some go through the library's default temp handling, some are paths we wrote ourselves. They're not consistent.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 11:49] Diana**: QA saw a batch fail last week and leave a pile of orphaned temp files behind — that's probably one of the ones you haven't found yet.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 11:56] Charlie**: Probably. I'm building the full inventory now so nothing gets missed once the hooks go in.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 13:58] Evan**: Once you've got the list, want a second pass to confirm nothing's hiding behind a library default?\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 13:59] Charlie**: Yeah, that'd help. I'll share the inventory once it's done.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 28 slack thread ocr temp file trace channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 07 2026 08 07 1003 charli trace everi place the ocr branch write a temp file we can t add cleanup hook until we know all the site that actual creat one 2026 08 07 10 06 alic how mani site so far 2026 08 07 10 19 charli more than i expect some go through the librari s default temp handl some are path we wrote ourselv they re not consist 2026 08 07 11 49 diana qa saw a batch fail last week and leav a pile of orphan temp file behind that s probabl one of the one you haven t found yet 2026 08 07 11 56 charli probabl i m build the full inventori now so noth get miss onc the hook go in 2026 08 07 13 58 evan onc you ve got the list want a second pas to confirm noth s hide behind a librari default 2026 08 07 13 59 charli yeah that d help i ll share the inventori onc it s done\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8d2f3568a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"id\": \"3b7fe675b930658f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2445177747775847, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.034959278253692425, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7334876, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8d2f3568a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1018, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:47\", \"token_count\": 315, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitted by the CLI do not match the defined schema, so this remains an open release blocker.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- SHA-256 hash is computed for every input stream and captured in the audit record.\\n\\n- Companion JSON schema pairs the input hash with the redaction map for each processed file.\\n\\n- Audit-log generation is wired into the CLI batch path.\\n\\n- CLI-emitted audit records validate cleanly against the defined companion JSON schema (currently failing verification).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitted by the CLI do not match the defined schema, so this remains an open release blocker.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-07-08**: Diana - Task Create (Open)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 26 sourc id src cu ciph 26 task id ciph 26 titl audit trail log status activ assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 07 08 descript build an audit trail system for the redact pipelin that captur a sha 256 hash of each input stream togeth with a companion json document record the redact map appli to that file then wire this audit log generat into the cli batch path a of the most recent verif pas the audit record emit by the cli do not match the defin schema so this remain an open releas blocker clickup task ciph 26 sourc id src cu ciph 26 task id ciph 26 titl audit trail log status activ assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 07 08 accept criterion sha 256 hash is comput for everi input stream and captur in the audit record companion json schema pair the input hash with the redact map for each process file audit log generat is wire into the cli batch path cli emit audit record valid clean against the defin companion json schema current fail verif clickup task ciph 26 sourc id src cu ciph 26 task id ciph 26 titl audit trail log status activ assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 07 08 descript build an audit trail system for the redact pipelin that captur a sha 256 hash of each input stream togeth with a companion json document record the redact map appli to that file then wire this audit log generat into the cli batch path a of the most recent verif pas the audit record emit by the cli do not match the defin schema so this remain an open releas blocker clickup task ciph 26 sourc id src cu ciph 26 task id ciph 26 titl audit trail log status activ assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 07 08 activ histori 2026 07 08 diana task creat open\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db230